# 🔴 Shell scripts stay LF, always.
#
# This repository is developed on Windows. Without this, git checks `entrypoint.sh` out with CRLF,
# Docker copies it in unchanged, and the container dies with `/bin/sh^M: bad interpreter` — an error
# that says nothing about line endings and sends you looking at the script's logic.
*.sh text eol=lf
docker/entrypoint.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
